  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Correct statements for the given reaction are:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/778bda23-9988-42ad-a01e-9e4c152d62e1.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 130px;\" /></p><p>A. Compound &lsquo;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&rsquo; is aromatic</p><p>B. The completion of above reaction is very slow</p><p>C. &lsquo;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&rsquo; shows tautomerism</p><p>D. The bond lengths of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> in compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> are found to be same</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "YDiO8",
      "text": "B, C and D only",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
